  "title": "Skyport Banquet Kitchens",
  "rules": [
    "Eight workers per kitchen have individually selectable actions and exchangeable tools.",
    "Chop raw ingredients into an empty bench, tend cooking, then plate a ready meal. Shared washing steam warms benches and can spoil old food.",
    "A loaded lift moves only with a second worker at its counterweight. Moving opens one passage and closes the other.",
    "Read a local departure order with empty hands. Serve a matching meal during its first eight ticks; service returns a dirty tray.",
    "Wash reservoirs share water and heat between nearby benches. Adjacent consenting partners can exchange cargo and its order tag.",
    "Role view shows a radius-two native patch. Human controls and animation await independent integration."
  ],
